    "enUS": {
      "description": "Calling all anglers!\r\n\r\nI'm in the market for some crab meat. Not just the usual shreds either, I'm talking whole claw. I've seen a big one crawling around under the docks, stealing bait and cutting lines.\r\n\r\nI'll pay a reward to anyone who brings me that thing's pincer. You'll also get a helping of the dish I whip up.\r\n\r\n-- Fimbo Greasemitz",
      "dialogue": {
        "18afb086741a6eddf3eb": "Yanked this right off that thing, huh? Impressive! With a little butter, and a dash of my secret spice blend, we're in for one hell of a meal!",
        "c8dd59d47ccf9d907905": "What's the word, $r?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring Trapclaw's Pincer to Fimbo Greasemitz.",
      "title": "WANTED: Trapclaw",
